<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Paper A · Learner paper</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-2/a/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 2 Course Review · Original Paper A</p><h1>Paper A · Learner paper</h1><p>40 listening/reading questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks. Independent course-review draft.</p><p class="note">Printable materials and answer references. Open the workspace for section clocks and local recording. Writing and speaking need self-review or review by your own teacher.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Paper A</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><nav class="links"><a href="#listening">Listening</a><a href="#reading">Reading</a><a href="#writing">Writing</a><a href="#speaking">Speaking</a></nav><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="listening">Listening · 20 minutes</h2><h3>L1 · Questions 1–5</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q1"><h3>1. What will the man do?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m01.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 打扫客厅</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 洗碗</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 买菜</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q2"><h3>2. When does the community activity begin?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m02.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 十点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 九点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 十二点</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q3"><h3>3. How often does the speaker wash dishes each week?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m03.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 两次</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十次</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 五次</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q4"><h3>4. Which walking plan fits the woman’s work schedule?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m04.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 七点到七点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 六点到六点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 七点到八点</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q5"><h3>5. Which change is supported by Xiao’an’s experience?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m05.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 每天晚些起床</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 晚上早点休息</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 每天多看电视</div></div></article></div><h3>L2 · Questions 6–10</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q6"><h3>6. Where will the woman go first?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m06.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 市场</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 家里</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 图书馆</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q7"><h3>7. How will they get to the library?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m07.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 坐公交车</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 坐地铁</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 走路</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q8"><h3>8. What should the man do just after getting off the bus?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m08.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 向左走</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 向右走</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 过马路</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q9"><h3>9. Which route meets the man’s stated needs tonight?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m09.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 河边的路</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 两条路都不走</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 商店那边的路</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q10"><h3>10. What is the final meeting arrangement?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m10.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 九点在公园</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十点半在图书馆</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 十点在公园</div></div></article></div><h3>L3 · Questions 11–15</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q11"><h3>11. How many bowls of noodles will they order?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m11.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 两碗</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 四碗</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 一碗</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q12"><h3>12. Which item does the woman want?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m12.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 蓝色小号</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 红色大号</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 蓝色大号</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q13"><h3>13. How much does the man’s order cost?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m13.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 十八块</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十五块</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 二十块</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q14"><h3>14. Which dish meets both guests’ food requirements?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m14.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 鸡蛋面</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 辣牛肉</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 白菜汤</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q15"><h3>15. What is the man’s final household job this evening?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m15.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下班后买牛奶</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 现在去商店</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 洗碗</div></div></article></div><h3>L4 · Questions 16–20</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q16"><h3>16. What weather is expected this afternoon?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m16.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 晴天</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 继续下雨</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 下雪</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q17"><h3>17. Why was the activity moved to the community centre?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m17.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 周日会下雨</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 公园周日不开</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 大家上午没空</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q18"><h3>18. Which walk fits the man’s available time?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m18.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 湖边来回四十分钟</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 两个地方都走一遍</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 小区里来回十五分钟</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q19"><h3>19. What did the group do immediately after watching the singing?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m19.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 跟老师写汉字</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 一起吃午饭</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 先回家</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q20"><h3>20. What can we infer about Xiaoyu’s view of the activity?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m20.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 她一直不想参加</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 她后来很喜欢这个活动</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 她只想知道回家的路</div></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="reading">Reading · 25 minutes</h2><h3>R1 · Questions 21–25</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q21"><h3>21. What does the mother ask Xiaolin to do?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">家务留言<br>小林：我今天要带奶奶去社区中心，不能擦桌子了。请你下午把桌子擦一下，我晚上回来再洗衣服。地已经扫过，你不用再扫。谢谢！<br>妈妈</p></div><p class="note">擦: wipe</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 擦桌子</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 洗衣服</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 扫地</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q22"><h3>22. When does the cooking activity now begin?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">社区通知<br>原定星期六上午九点的做饭活动改为下午两点开始，四点结束。请一点半以后到一楼厨房，不要去二楼教室。上午厨房要打扫，不能提前使用。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 上午九点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午两点</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 下午一点半</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q23"><h3>23. How many times will Xiaoning water the plants this week?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小宁家的安排<br>周一、周三、周五：小宁给花浇水，每次十分钟。<br>周二、周四：爸爸浇水。<br>周末：妈妈浇水。<br>小宁这周在家，也按这个安排做，没有和家人交换。</p></div><p class="note">浇水: water plants</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 两次</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 五次</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 三次</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q24"><h3>24. Which walk fits Lin An’s time and the opening information?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">林安的记录<br>这周下班后六点半到家，七点吃晚饭。附近的公园每天晚上六点关门，小区里的路一直可以走。林安想在晚饭前散步二十分钟，也想留十分钟休息。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 六点半到六点五十分在公园走</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 六点半到六点五十分在小区走</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 六点半到七点十分在小区走</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q25"><h3>25. Which plan does Xiaozhou’s diary support continuing?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小周的运动日记<br>以前我一周只运动一次，每次跑一个小时，第二天很累。从上周开始，我每周二、周四、周六各走二十分钟。三次都没有觉得累，我想下周继续这样做。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 每周走三次，每次二十分钟</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 每次跑一个小时</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 一周完全不运动</div></div></article></div><h3>R2 · Questions 26–30</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q26"><h3>26. Where should Xiaochen go first?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小陈：今天先到社区中心帮忙吧，图书馆的书明天还也可以。我们在社区中心门口见。活动结束后，我再陪你去市场。别先去图书馆，我怕在那里找不到你。<br>小许</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 图书馆</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 市场</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 社区中心</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q27"><h3>27. Which transport does the notice ask visitors to use?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">图书馆交通提醒<br>本周六地铁二号线不开，去图书馆请坐十路公交车，在书店站下车。十路车每十五分钟一班。图书馆旁边没有停车的地方，请不要开车来。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 地铁二号线</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十路公交车</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 自己开车</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q28"><h3>28. What is the first direction after leaving the bus?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">从书店站到图书馆<br>下车后，先沿着书店前面的路往左走。到第二个路口再向右，经过一家小商店就能看见图书馆。不要在第一个路口转弯，那里通向学校。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 往左走</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 在第一个路口右转</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 先走进学校</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q29"><h3>29. Which route best fits Xiaofang’s stated situation?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">路线卡<br>甲：走河边，十分钟到，中间没有可以坐的地方。<br>乙：走商店街，二十分钟到，中间有三张长椅。<br>小方今天有四十分钟空闲，想陪走路容易累的爷爷去图书馆。</p></div><p class="note">长椅: bench</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 甲，河边</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 两条都一定来不及</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 乙，商店街</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q30"><h3>30. What is the updated time and place?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">活动更新<br>明天有大雨，原来上午十点在河边画画的活动改到社区中心三楼。三楼上午有课，只能下午使用，所以请大家下午一点到。画画材料不用自己带。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下午一点，社区中心三楼</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 上午十点，河边</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 上午十点，社区中心三楼</div></div></article></div><h3>R3 · Questions 31–35</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q31"><h3>31. How many portions of rice are on the order?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">订单确认<br>米饭三份、面条一碗、青菜两份、热茶一壶。四位客人里只有小安吃面条，其他三位吃米饭。店员请大家检查数量，确认后再开始做饭。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 一份</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 三份</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 四份</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q32"><h3>32. Which apron does Xiao’an request?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小方：你上次买的白色小号围裙我试过了，做饭时太紧。这次请帮我买中号，颜色还是白色，不要黄色。店里如果没有白色中号，就先别买。<br>小安</p></div><p class="note">围裙: apron</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 白色小号</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 黄色中号</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 白色中号</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q33"><h3>33. What is the total cost of the meal?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">午饭账单<br>面条：十六元。<br>青菜：六元。<br>热茶：免费。<br>应付：二十二元。<br>客人付了三十元，店员找回八元。客人没有另外买饮料，账单已经结清。</p></div><p class="note">账单: bill</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 二十二元</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 三十元</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 八元</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q34"><h3>34. Which purchase meets the quantity and budget requirements?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">采购卡<br>周末四个人来家里，每人需要一瓶水。甲店四瓶八元，乙店三瓶六元，丙店四瓶十二元。小周最多带十元，只能去一家店，不想有人没有水喝。</p></div><p class="note">采购: purchase supplies</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 乙店三瓶六元</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 甲店四瓶八元</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 丙店四瓶十二元</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q35"><h3>35. What should Xiaoning do first after class?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">爸爸的留言<br>客人六点来，家里的杯子不够。小宁五点下课，回家路上的商店五点半关门。请小宁下课先买杯子再回家。我五点半回来做饭，买菜已经办好了。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 先回家等爸爸</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 先去买菜</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 在回家路上买杯子</div></div></article></div><h3>R4 · Questions 36–40</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q36"><h3>36. What is the forecast for Saturday afternoon?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">周六天气<br>上午：多云，十八度。<br>下午：下雨，十六度。<br>晚上：雨停，有风。<br>公园活动负责人提醒：想在外面拍照的同学请上午来，下午的活动改在室内。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 有太阳</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下雨</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 雨停了</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q37"><h3>37. Why did they choose the afternoon?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小林：周日上午天气很好，我们上午去公园吧。<br>小方：我上午要在家照顾弟弟，妈妈十二点才回来。下午我有空，公园也开门。<br>小林：好，那下午两点在公园门口见。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 小方上午要照顾弟弟</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 公园上午不开</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 上午天气不好</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q38"><h3>38. Which route leaves the requested resting time?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">散步选择<br>小安午饭后一共只有三十分钟，还想留十分钟坐着休息。公园路线要走二十五分钟，小区路线要走十五分钟。两条路都平坦，今天也都开放。</p></div><p class="note">平坦: flat, even</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 公园二十五分钟路线</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 两条路线都走</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 小区十五分钟路线</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q39"><h3>39. What did the group do just after making the little paper lanterns?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">社区春节日记<br>星期日我们九点到社区中心，先跟老师做红色的小纸灯，再把灯放到门口。十点大家坐下来听故事，十一点一起包饺子。午饭后我把自己做的灯带回家了。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 一起包饺子</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 把灯放到门口</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 把灯带回家</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q40"><h3>40. What does Xiao’an’s behaviour suggest about a future visit?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小安的消息<br>昨天第一次去社区的春节活动，我原来怕自己听不懂。回来后，我把活动照片发给朋友，还问老师下次能不能带朋友一起参加。我已经把下次活动的日期写进日历了。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 她愿意再去参加</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 她决定不再参加</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 她忘记活动日期了</div></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="writing">Writing · 20 minutes</h2><p>Both tasks share 20 minutes. Write on paper or in your own text editor. This review page does not save answers.</p><section class="box" id="W1"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W1</p><h2>Reply to a rainy-weekend change</h2><p>Reply to Xiaolin in Chinese. Say whether you can meet at the community centre at two on Saturday and whether you prefer cooking or drawing. Give a reason for your activity choice. Suggest another workable arrangement or ask one relevant question. You may invent details. About 40-60 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">小周：星期六下雨，公园活动改在社区中心，下午两点开始。你能来吗？你想参加做饭还是画画？我两种都可以。<br>小林</p></div><ul><li>Answer whether you can meet at the stated time and place.</li><li>Choose cooking or drawing, or explain a feasible alternative.</li><li>Give a reason related to the activity choice.</li><li>Suggest a workable alternative or ask a relevant question.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="W2"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W2</p><h2>Describe a community activity</h2><p>Use the fictional activity card to tell a classmate about last Saturday. Include when and where it happened, describe at least two activities in sequence, and give one feeling or reason. Write connected Chinese sentences. About 80-120 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum. You may add plausible details without contradicting the card.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">时间：上周六上午<br>地点：社区中心<br>九点：和老师做小纸灯<br>十点：和同学学做面条<br>十二点：一起吃午饭<br>结束后：把纸灯送给家人<br>感受：自己选择，也可以写不喜欢的地方并说明原因</p></div><ul><li>Identify last Saturday morning.</li><li>Identify the community centre.</li><li>Describe one activity from the card.</li><li>Describe a second activity with a consistent sequence.</li><li>Give one feeling or a reason.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="speaking">Speaking · 10 minutes</h2><section class="box" id="S1"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S1</p><h2>Arrange a meal and a meeting</h2><p>A classmate is arranging Saturday lunch with you. Respond in Chinese to four fixed audio prompts. Each prompt plays twice; then allow 15 seconds to prepare and up to 25 seconds to record. Invent details if you wish. Four responses form one task out of eight; the recording does not adapt to your answers.</p><p>The classmate asks about food needs, offers two meals, asks for your reason, and then introduces a later meeting time.</p><h3>Prompt S1-1</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-1.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-2</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-2.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-3</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-3.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-4</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-4.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Each audio prompt plays twice. After it ends, allow 15 seconds to prepare and 25 seconds to record using your own recording app. Four responses = one task /8.</p><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="S2"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S2</p><h2>Choose a weekend activity</h2><p>Use the two activity cards to recommend one plan to a classmate who is free from one to five on Saturday, has at most thirty yuan, and prefers not to be outside in the rain. Compare the options, state your choice, give two reasons based on the cards, and describe a short workable plan. You have 60 seconds to prepare and up to 90 seconds to speak. Other choices are valid if you explain how their constraints can be managed.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">周六下午可能下雨。<br>甲：社区中心做饭课，下午两点到四点，室内，二十五元；从车站走五分钟。<br>乙：公园散步，下午一点半到三点，室外，免费；从车站走十五分钟；可借伞。<br>同学：一点到五点有空，最多三十元，希望不在雨里活动。</p></div><ul><li>Compare at least one feature of both options.</li><li>Choose a plan.</li><li>Give a first evidence-based reason.</li><li>Give a second evidence-based reason.</li><li>Describe a short plan consistent with the time and place.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section></main></body></html>